{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-instanton","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:categorical-instanton","kind":"definition","title":"Categorical instanton","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-hodge-star"],"tags":["instanton","self-dual"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalInstanton","text":"categorical-instanton.md","leanSource":"categorical-instanton.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:categorical-instanton\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Hodge star <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q</code>. The connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code> is an <strong>instanton</strong> if its curvature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_\\nabla \\in \\Omega^2(A)</code> is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q</code>-self-dual: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q F_\\nabla =  F_\\nabla</code>. Equivalently, the curvature factors through the self-dual projection.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.md","heading":"Definition","number":"4.18.1","page":"b/def-categorical-instanton","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":56},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalInstanton","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
